Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.87,0:00:05.93,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}年前 就在这片球场上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.93,0:00:07.26,TL,,0,0,0,,他坐着轮椅离开
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:09.43,TL,,0,0,0,,不知道自己还能不能回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.43,0:00:12.03,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}年后 他躺倒在同一片红土上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:14.63,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 是以冠军的身份
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.87,0:00:26.80,TL,,0,0,0,,中间隔着的 是{\fs78}3{\fs68}次大满贯决赛失利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:29.32,TL,,0,0,0,,和整整{\fs78}125{\fs68}场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:34.90,TL,,0,0,0,,就在这个{\fs78}10{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:36.69,TL,,0,0,0,,他把这一年收了个尾 上海
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.69,0:00:38.25,TL,,0,0,0,,阿尔卡拉斯提前出局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.25,0:00:39.92,TL,,0,0,0,,年终世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}提前锁定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:42.99,TL,,0,0,0,,他是德国网球史上第一位年终第一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.87,0:00:55.19,TL,,0,0,0,,维也纳 他用一场胜利把积分钉死
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.87,0:01:06.04,TL,,0,0,0,,下周一 {\fs78}29{\fs68}岁的兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.04,0:01:08.82,TL,,0,0,0,,名字后面将第一次缀上 世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.82,0:01:10.45,TL,,0,0,0,,以他的年龄首登榜首
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.45,0:01:12.73,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}52{\fs68}年来只有一个人比他更晚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.73,0:01:14.65,TL,,0,0,0,,而 第一次当上年终第一 这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.65,0:01:16.79,TL,,0,0,0,,他比阿加西的纪录还要老{\fs78}3{\fs68}天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.79,0:01:18.39,TL,,0,0,0,,是历史第一人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.87,0:01:26.85,TL,,0,0,0,,你可以说这个第一来得晚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.85,0:01:29.49,TL,,0,0,0,,但在他看来 它先得回答另一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.49,0:01:31.21,TL,,0,0,0,,他到底配不配
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.87,0:01:33.44,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2020{\fs68}年 纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:35.75,TL,,0,0,0,,空荡荡的阿瑟 阿什球场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.75,0:01:37.90,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}23{\fs68}岁的兹维列夫第一次站上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.90,0:01:40.39,TL,,0,0,0,,大满贯决赛 对手蒂姆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.17,0:01:53.84,TL,,0,0,0,,他两盘在手 决胜盘打到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.84,0:01:55.58,TL,,0,0,0,,迎来自己的发球胜赛局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.58,0:01:57.75,TL,,0,0,0,,离奖杯 只剩两分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.17,0:02:06.67,TL,,0,0,0,,然后 剧本翻了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.67,0:02:09.71,TL,,0,0,0,,蒂姆连扳两盘 抢七锁定胜局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.71,0:02:11.06,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}小时{\fs78}2{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:14.01,TL,,0,0,0,,兹维列夫把到手的冠军打了出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.97,0:02:25.86,TL,,0,0,0,,那年他说 自己总有一天会站回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.86,0:02:28.13,TL,,0,0,0,,没人想到 这一天要等{\fs78}6{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:31.52,TL,,0,0,0,,更没人想到 等他的先是一张轮椅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:35.67,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年 巴黎半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:36.97,TL,,0,0,0,,对面是纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.97,0:02:39.28,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}个多小时 第二盘还没打完
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:41.22,TL,,0,0,0,,比分{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:43.75,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘的最后一个球 他追一记正手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:46.84,TL,,0,0,0,,右脚踝在红土上拧成了不该有的角度
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.84,0:02:49.99,TL,,0,0,0,,惨叫声里 他坐着轮椅离开了球场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.67,0:03:00.59,TL,,0,0,0,,诊断结果
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.59,0:03:03.11,TL,,0,0,0,,右脚踝{\fs78}3{\fs68}条外侧韧带全部撕裂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.11,0:03:04.39,TL,,0,0,0,,随即手术
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.39,0:03:07.57,TL,,0,0,0,,秋季又查出骨水肿 整个赛季报销
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.57,0:03:09.76,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}个月后他才重新站上赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:11.82,TL,,0,0,0,,而他自己的说法是 网球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:13.80,TL,,0,0,0,,又花了一年才找回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.80,0:03:16.33,TL,,0,0,0,,那时没人再提{\fs78}2020{\fs68}年那句 站回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.33,0:03:19.07,TL,,0,0,0,,能站回来走路 已经算赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.67,0:03:25.97,TL,,0,0,0,,可他真的一步一步打了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.97,0:03:27.75,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年 还是巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:29.01,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛对阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.01,0:03:30.78,TL,,0,0,0,,他一度两盘比一盘领先
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:32.82,TL,,0,0,0,,然后又被连扳两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.77,0:03:40.17,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年 墨尔本决赛对辛纳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.17,0:03:42.38,TL,,0,0,0,,对方全场没有送出一个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.38,0:03:44.52,TL,,0,0,0,,直落{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘把他打回更衣室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:47.47,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}次大满贯决赛 {\fs78}3{\fs68}次亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:49.63,TL,,0,0,0,,奥运会金牌 总决赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.63,0:03:50.72,TL,,0,0,0,,大师赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:52.90,TL,,0,0,0,,他什么都有 只差这一座
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.90,0:03:54.43,TL,,0,0,0,,最强的无冕之王
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.43,0:03:57.58,TL,,0,0,0,,这句话从夸奖 慢慢变成了判决
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:59.90,TL,,0,0,0,,而且面前只剩最后一级台阶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:02.26,TL,,0,0,0,,公开赛年代 只有伦德尔和穆雷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:04.44,TL,,0,0,0,,是以决赛四连败开局的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.44,0:04:05.28,TL,,0,0,0,,再输一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:08.01,TL,,0,0,0,,他就要和这份名单并排站着
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:19.04,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年的一月
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:21.18,TL,,0,0,0,,同样的剧本差点又演一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:22.21,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.21,0:04:25.57,TL,,0,0,0,,他和阿尔卡拉斯打了{\fs78}5{\fs68}小时{\fs78}27{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:32.01,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 又一次发球胜赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.01,0:04:33.60,TL,,0,0,0,,又一次被破
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.37,0:04:40.78,TL,,0,0,0,,半年后 巴黎 这一回
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:42.48,TL,,0,0,0,,签表先替他让开了路
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.48,0:04:43.99,TL,,0,0,0,,阿尔卡拉斯因伤缺席
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:45.59,TL,,0,0,0,,辛纳第二轮爆冷出局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:46.94,TL,,0,0,0,,德约止步第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.94,0:04:49.52,TL,,0,0,0,,他一路没碰上一个世界前{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:50.56,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛对科博利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:53.03,TL,,0,0,0,,他第四盘抢七{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}领先被翻盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.03,0:04:54.36,TL,,0,0,0,,还抽了筋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:28.77,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘 他{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}收官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.77,0:05:31.03,TL,,0,0,0,,冠军点落地 他倒在红土上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:32.76,TL,,0,0,0,,久久没有起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.93,0:05:36.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, very much.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是的 非常
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:39.39,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Thank you very much.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.81,0:05:41.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Six-un, quatre-six.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N六比一 四比六
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.13,0:05:43.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Six-quatre, six-sept, six-un.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N六比四 六比七 六比一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:25.60,TL,,0,0,0,,这一胜 是他大满贯的第{\fs78}125{\fs68}场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:28.08,TL,,0,0,0,,公开赛年代 没有人为了第一座奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:29.88,TL,,0,0,0,,赢下过这么多场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:32.77,TL,,0,0,0,,第{\fs78}41{\fs68}次参赛 他终于捧杯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.73,0:06:39.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I was laying on this court with an injury{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我曾躺在这片球场上 带着伤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.53,0:06:42.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that I didn't know if I would ever come back from.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不知道自己还能不能回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.73,0:06:45.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I lost a Grand Slam final here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我在这里输过大满贯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:49.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}All of those memories — they're not wiped out, they're still with me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那些记忆不会被抹去 都还跟着我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:52.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But this one will beat all of them.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但这一次 会盖过它们全部
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:55.45,TL,,0,0,0,,故事到这里 本来已经够圆满
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.45,0:06:57.03,TL,,0,0,0,,但今年还没完 温网
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.03,0:06:59.04,TL,,0,0,0,,他职业生涯第一次打进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.04,0:07:01.78,TL,,0,0,0,,先赢一盘 还是输给了辛纳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:14.10,TL,,0,0,0,,两个月后在纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:15.56,TL,,0,0,0,,他成了头号种子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:18.03,TL,,0,0,0,,辛纳因膝伤提前结束了赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.03,0:07:20.36,TL,,0,0,0,,首轮 他离出局只差两分
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:22.79,TL,,0,0,0,,次轮 他打满{\fs78}5{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:29.26,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛 他{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}拿下谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:30.78,TL,,0,0,0,,赛点兑现的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:32.95,TL,,0,0,0,,他甚至没意识到比赛已经结束
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.95,0:07:35.11,TL,,0,0,0,,转身走回底线 准备接发球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.11,0:07:37.41,TL,,0,0,0,,几秒之后才反应过来 {\fs78}30{\fs68}年了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.41,0:07:39.88,TL,,0,0,0,,德国人又一次在纽约捧杯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.63,0:07:55.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match — Zverev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N全场比赛结束 兹维列夫夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:57.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Alexander Zverev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N亚历山大 兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.23,0:07:59.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Zverev doesn't know he's winning.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N兹维列夫还不知道自己已经赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:01.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He doesn't even know he's winning.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他甚至不知道自己赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.23,0:08:11.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}We went 30 years without winning a Grand Slam title{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们等了三十年没拿过大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.43,0:08:14.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and now we've won two within the span of three months.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N如今三个月里拿了两个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:27.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}God has seen how hard we worked,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N上天看见了我们有多拼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.03,0:08:36.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}how much we suffered, how much pain we went through.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们多能扛 受过多少苦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:39.47,TL,,0,0,0,,但账本的另一面 必须摊开
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.47,0:08:41.53,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 他对辛纳{\fs78}0{\fs68}胜{\fs78}5{\fs68}负
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:43.81,TL,,0,0,0,,全年只从对方手里抢下一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:45.80,TL,,0,0,0,,法网夺冠 他没碰前{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.80,0:08:46.62,TL,,0,0,0,,年终第一
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.62,0:08:48.84,TL,,0,0,0,,是在辛纳宣布赛季报销{\fs78}6{\fs68}天之后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:49.83,TL,,0,0,0,,锁定的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.83,0:08:52.83,TL,,0,0,0,,质疑者说 这不是封王 是让位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:54.58,TL,,0,0,0,,而他的回答是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:03.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That I clinched year-end No. 1 is, of course,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N锁定年终第一这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.53,0:09:07.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}with Jannik being out, unfortunate.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在辛纳缺席的情况下 当然不走运
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:11.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But I think, once it happens{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但我想 等它真的发生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.63,0:09:15.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}it will be a special moment for me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N会是属于我的特殊时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:19.10,TL,,0,0,0,,他说 他想和最强的人同场竞技
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:21.15,TL,,0,0,0,,哪怕今年被对方赢了{\fs78}5{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:23.49,TL,,0,0,0,,这个月 巴黎和都灵还在等他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.49,0:09:25.52,TL,,0,0,0,,这个 第一 的成色 接下来{\fs78}3{\fs68}周
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:27.68,TL,,0,0,0,,还得他自己一场一场验
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.37,0:09:32.15,TL,,0,0,0,,所以最后 把问题留给你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:34.63,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}次决赛 {\fs78}3{\fs68}次失利 一次重伤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.63,0:09:36.89,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}125{\fs68}场胜利 这个年终第一
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.89,0:09:38.95,TL,,0,0,0,,是{\fs78}6{\fs68}年坚持熬出来的实力兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:41.03,TL,,0,0,0,,还是对手缺席的时代让位？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.03,0:09:43.48,TL,,0,0,0,,你站哪边 评论区见
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:50.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Very quickly — and at a Grand Slam, it took longer.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来得都很快 只有大满贯等得最久
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.23,0:09:52.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And now, no matter what happens —{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而现在 无论发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.43,0:09:54.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I will always be a Grand Slam champion,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我永远都是大满贯冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.63,0:09:56.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and nobody can take that away from me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N没人能把这个夺走
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.47,0:10:06.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And maybe that does give me some freedom.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也许 这反而给了我一种自由
